e=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e5654af7c954e1c0\" href=\"?note=e5654af7c954e1c0\" title=\"67-df-godel-encoding\">67-df-godel-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"189f5355af0e487c\" href=\"?note=189f5355af0e487c\" title=\"67-df-certified-proof\">67-df-certified-proof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3fa0d0f598b791bc\" href=\"?note=3fa0d0f598b791bc\" title=\"67-df-proof-representation\">67-df-proof-representation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Theorem 1, equation G"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"23"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"34"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\supseteq Q\">\\(T\\supseteq Q\\)</span> 为固定有效算术呈示，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"6a4c234306a0ec0c\" href=\"?note=6a4c234306a0ec0c\" title=\"67-df-provability-predicate\">67-df-provability-predicate</a>。取本册强原始递归句法编号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>；数词记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a> 的公式类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Gdl}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Gdl}_T\\)</span> 是下式定义的固定点谓词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>此处固定标准证明算术化，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)\\in\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)\\in\\Sigma_1\\)</span>；不是任意逐数正确的非标准呈示公式。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本原子固定的编号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 与所引 Proof_T、Prf_T、Prov_T 采用的呈示编号相同；所有编码变换均在该固定编号下使用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本条的固定编号为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=c_{L_A}\">\\(g=c_{L_A}\\)</span>。每个出现的有效理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 绑定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"189f5355af0e487c\" href=\"?note=189f5355af0e487c\" title=\"67-df-certified-proof\">67-df-certified-proof</a> 的呈示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_A\">\\(E_A\\)</span>；使用内部证明公式时固定同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\\)</span> 及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"3fa0d0f598b791bc\" href=\"?note=3fa0d0f598b791bc\" title=\"67-df-proof-representation\">67-df-proof-representation</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{A,E_A}(\\mathrm{Prf}_A,e_{\\mathrm{prf},A})\">\\(\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{A,E_A}(\\mathrm{Prf}_A,e_{\\mathrm{prf},A})\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Gdl}_T(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\nG\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\land\nQ\\vdash\\bigl(G\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(G)})\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Gdl}_T(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\nG\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\land\nQ\\vdash\\bigl(G\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(G)})\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 2.1 要求在 Q 中得到 Π1 固定点；旧条目只要求 T 内等价而未约束复杂度，会遗漏其真实性与否定为 Σ1 的关键条件。存在性由固定点引理及标准 Σ1 可证明性公式给出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"6a4c234306a0ec0c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"e5654af7c954e1c0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-godel-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-strong-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"a329235da6144513","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]","embed":false},{"tar